You harness the chaos created by high insanity.

Each time you trigger an insanity chaotic effect with a power higher than [28, 19, 15, 12, 10 (TL1-5)] or lower than [-28, -19, -15, -12, -10 (TL1-5)] you gain a chaos orb for 10 turns (this effect can only happen once per turn).

Each orb increases your damage by 3% and can stack up to [2, 3, 4, 5, 6 (TL1-5)].
